        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.lostdogfilms.net/personhood",
          "overview": "In a near-future world, a lonely, physically challenged man purchases a companion robot to escape his isolation, but his own insecurities and a jealous brother threaten his chances of ever finding love.",
